menu "NRF24 Link Monitor"

    config NRF24_SIM_MODE
        bool "Simulation mode (no NRF24 transmitter needed)"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, the firmware generates synthetic packets internally
            instead of reading from the NRF24L01. Cycles NORMAL → WEAK →
            INTERFERENCE every 20 s. No transmitter hardware required.

endmenu
